content.p:
 If the offender refuses to make the promise or maliciously fails to deposit the security within the specified period, the court may require them to make the promise or deposit the security by imposing a period of detention for security reasons. The period of detention for security reasons may not be for more than two months. It is executed in the same way as a short custodial sentence (Art. 79

 This Art. has been repealed (AS 2016 1249; BBl 2012 4721).
